<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Rugby union-England beat Ireland in 'A' match.</title>
<headline>Rugby union-England beat Ireland in 'A' match.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>England beat Ireland 44-30 (half-time 15-22) in an 'A' international at Donnybrook on Friday.</p>
<p>--Dublin newsroom 353-1-661-3377.</p>
</text>
